  "geometry": "getBoundingClientRect at load with the clip held on its first frame"
 },
 "caveats": [
  "Every picture is a drawn stand-in and the clip is made from three of them; LCP with stand-ins says little about LCP with photographs.",
  "photographWeightPoster replaces only the poster with a synthetic 188 KB JPEG sent through the throttled network: a sensitivity test.",
  "At 1440px Chrome reports the clip as the LCP element, because the stand-in poster has too few bytes for its area to count."
 ],
